{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53424","headline":"爲樵 · 林藻","name":"爲樵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"致政惭轻举，爲樵亦易穷。\n文章还古道，礼数逐秋风。\n独鹤千松下，万航一水中。\n最怜当路草，衰败与人同。\n（《莆风清籁集》卷六十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林藻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}